---
<section id="top" class="inner-hero">
        <div class="page-shell">
            <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
            <h1>How can we help?</h1>
            <p>Start with a guide below. If you can't find what you need, the contact form is at the bottom of this page and Philip replies in person within one business day.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
        <div class="balanced-grid-3">
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Getting started</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/getting-started.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Signup to first report</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">How to sign up, configure your first workflow, and invite engineers.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Workflows</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/workflows.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Questions, reports, limits</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">How workflows are structured, how questions are configured, and what limits apply.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Engineers</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/engineers.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Adding, removing, seats</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">How to add engineers to your firm, manage seats, and remove access.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Team management</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/team.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Admins, members, invitations</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">How to manage admin roles, invite members, and control access.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Plans &amp; billing</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/plans.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Pricing, Direct Debit, upgrades</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">How plans are structured, how Direct Debit works, and how to upgrade or cancel.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Data &amp; privacy</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/privacy.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Storage, exports, GDPR</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Where data is stored, how to export records, and GDPR obligations.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Troubleshooting</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/troubleshooting.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Common issues and fixes</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Solutions to the most common problems with WhatsApp, reports, and account access.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">FAQ</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title"><a href="/pages/help/faq.html" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">Frequently asked questions</a></h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Quick answers to the questions we hear most often.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight" id="contact-form-section" aria-labelledby="contact-form-section-title">
        <div class="single-panel-layout">
            <div class="contact-form-shell">
                <div class="form-card-header">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span>
                    <h2 id="contact-form-section-title">Still stuck? Tell us what is not working.</h2>
                    <p class="contact-copy">Email Philip directly: <a href="mailto:hello@quickler.co">hello@quickler.co</a> or use the form below. He replies in person within one business day.</p>
                </div>
                <form class="contact-form" id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjknoeqd" method="POST" data-agent-form="quickler-contact" data-async-form="quickler-contact" data-form-state="idle" data-success-message="Sent. Philip will reply in person." data-success-status="Form submitted successfully" data-submit-button="#submit-btn" aria-describedby="contact-form-help contact-form-status">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">Your name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Jane Smith" autocomplete="name" required data-agent-field="name">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="company">Company</label>
                        <input type="text" id="company" name="company" placeholder="Acme Inspections Ltd" autocomplete="organization" data-agent-field="company">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">Your email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required data-agent-field="email">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="lane">Which route fits best?</label>
                        <select id="lane" name="lane" data-agent-field="lane">
                            <option value="">Select a route</option>
                            <option value="Workflows">Workflows</option>
                            <option value="Invoices &amp; Purchase Orders">Invoices &amp; Purchase Orders</option>
                            <option value="Unsure">Unsure</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="report-volume">How often does this happen?</label>
                        <input type="text" id="report-volume" name="report_volume" placeholder="For example: 15 per week, 40 per month, or 8 jobs per day" data-agent-field="report_volume">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="report-type">What workflow, report, record, or process should quickler start with?</label>
                        <input type="text" id="report-type" name="report_type" placeholder="For example: site inspection report, maintenance visit sheet, engineer job record, or grant application workflow" data-agent-field="report_type">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="sample-access">Could you share examples of the current workflow or inputs?</label>
                        <input type="text" id="sample-access" name="sample_access" placeholder="For example: yes, anonymised examples / maybe / not yet" data-agent-field="sample_access">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="message">Your enquiry</label>
                        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What is the workflow, how is it handled now, where does it slow down or go wrong, and what would a better version look like?" required data-agent-field="message"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <p class="visually-hidden" id="contact-form-help">Required fields are name, email, and message. If unsure which lane fits, choose Unsure and describe the workflow in the message field.</p>
                    <p class="visually-hidden" id="contact-form-status" aria-live="polite" data-agent-status="form-status">Form ready</p>

                    <div class="form-submit">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="submit-btn">Send enquiry</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="form-note">By sending this form, you agree that quickler may use the details you provide to review your enquiry and reply to you. See the <a href="/pages/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
